@Product.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002

### 12. View Category - Danh sách danh mục
GET {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 12b. View Category Detail - Chi tiết một danh mục
GET {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/categories/10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### 13. Create Category - Tạo mới danh mục
POST {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bánh Mì & Điểm Tâm",
  "displayOrder": 5,
  "isActive": true
}

### 14. Update Category - Cập nhật danh mục
PUT {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/categories/10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cà Phê Truyền Thống Đặc Biệt",
  "displayOrder": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### 15. Delete Category - Xóa danh mục (chỉ xóa khi không có món)
DELETE {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/categories/10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
Accept: application/json

### 16. View Product - Danh sách món ăn / đồ uống
GET {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 17. View Product Detail - Chi tiết món kèm Size & Topping
GET {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### 18. Search & Filter Product - Tìm kiếm & Lọc
GET {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products?keyword=Phin&minPrice=20000&maxPrice=50000&sortBy=price&isDescending=false&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 19. Create Product - Tạo món mới kèm Options
POST {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "name": "Cà Phê Muối LowLand",
  "description": "Lớp kem muối béo mặn hòa cùng cà phê phin đậm đà thơm ngát",
  "basePrice": 35000,
  "imageUrl": "https://placehold.co/300",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "options": [
    {
      "optionType": "SIZE",
      "name": "Size M",
      "extraPrice": 0,
      "isAvailable": true
    },
    {
      "optionType": "SIZE",
      "name": "Size L",
      "extraPrice": 8000,
      "isAvailable": true
    },
    {
      "optionType": "TOPPING",
      "name": "Kem Muối Thêm",
      "extraPrice": 10000,
      "isAvailable": true
    }
  ]
}

### 20. Update Product - Cập nhật thông tin món
PUT {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "name": "Phin Sữa Đá LowLand (Công Thức Mới)",
  "description": "Cà phê phin thơm ngon, đậm đà với sữa đặc béo ngậy chuẩn gu Việt",
  "basePrice": 32000,
  "imageUrl": "https://placehold.co/300",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "options": [
    {
      "optionType": "SIZE",
      "name": "Size S",
      "extraPrice": 0,
      "isAvailable": true
    },
    {
      "optionType": "SIZE",
      "name": "Size M",
      "extraPrice": 6000,
      "isAvailable": true
    },
    {
      "optionType": "SIZE",
      "name": "Size L",
      "extraPrice": 12000,
      "isAvailable": true
    }
  ]
}

### Toggle Stock - Bật/Tắt nhanh Còn hàng / Hết hàng
PATCH {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/toggle-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isAvailable": false
}

### 21. Delete Product - Xóa mềm món (IsDeleted = true)
DELETE {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### 22. Upload Product Image to Cloudinary
POST {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/upload-image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="coffee_sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 23. Delete Product Image on Cloudinary
DELETE {{Product.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/images/lowland-coffee/products/sample_public_id
Accept: application/json

